flowchart LR
    A[Runtime Request] --> B[AI Firewall]
    B --> C{Policy Decision}
    C -- Allow --> D[Model / Agent Flow]
    C -- Block --> E[Refuse]
    C -- Redact --> F[Safe Context]
    C -- Escalate --> G[Human Review]
    C -- Rephrase --> H[Safe Response]

    D --> I[Tool Call Check]
    I --> J{Allowed Tool?}
    J -- Yes --> K[Execute Tool]
    J -- No --> G

    K --> L[Replay Record]
    E --> L
    F --> L
    G --> L
    H --> L

    L --> M[Observability / SIEM / Scorecard]
